        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "Oq8c5",
          "name": "component/blog-post-body-block",
          "reusable": true,
          "width": 720,
          "fill": "$canvas-white",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 24,
          "padding": [
            24,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "v2taLu",
              "name": "lead-paragraph",
              "fill": "$text-ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Agent systems do not become trustworthy because the interface says they are autonomous. They become trustworthy when every handoff, tool call, and decision path can be read by the people accountable for the outcome.",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "w85JKY",
              "name": "paragraph",
              "fill": "$text-ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The clearest product surfaces treat governance as part of the workflow rather than an administrative layer added afterward. Approval queues, trace views, and escalation states should feel ordinary, legible, and fast.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "zaZwz",
              "name": "section-heading",
              "fill": "$text-ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Start with the review path",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 32,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": -0.32
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "VOsjE",
              "name": "paragraph",
              "fill": "$text-ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Before adding more automation, define which decisions need human review, which can be sampled, and which should be blocked until context improves.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "pmmW6",
          "name": "component/blog-post-pullquote",
          "reusable": true,
          "width": 720,
          "fill": "$canvas-white",
          "stroke": {
